  "instructions": [
    "Heat the air fryer to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large bowl, mix together the ginger paste and vegetable broth.",
    "Add the brown rice and stir until coated with the ginger paste and broth mixture.",
    "Transfer the rice mixture to the air fryer basket and cook for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the diced tomatoes, red bell pepper, yellow bell pepper, artichoke hearts, and Kalamata olives to the rice mixture and stir to combine.",
    "Continue cooking for an additional 10-12 minutes, or until the rice is cooked and the vegetables are tender.",
    "Stir in some chopped fresh parsley and adjust seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
